{{Description|This enemy has a higher RES to {{Color|[[Electro]] DMG|nobold=1}}.<br /><br />Zip Zap is a type of ironclad electromagnetic Murmurin TD that attracts metal to form a protective shell around itself. Electric arcs are faintly visible through cracks in its metallic armor.<br /><br />They may attach themselves to other Clamorling Tacet Discords to provide power amplification. When spent, Zip Zaps reverse the flow of their electricity to recharge themselves.<br /><br />People in Lahai-Roi often catch Zip Zaps in the wild as an emergency power source.|Description when discovered}}

